Dear all,

In preparation for some involved work going on in the LaTeX3 SVN  
repository, we now have an official RSS feed for the SVN repository:
   <http://www.latex-project.org/latex3svn.rss>

Those of us interested in keeping close track of the code and  
discussing changes to it have a better option, however. You can elect  
to receive email notifications for each commit containing the commit  
message and complete diff of the changes. Send me (or us) an email and  
I can add you to the list.

Cheers,
Will



